  "limitations": [
    "Pilot only; too few examples for a reliable general-purpose sentiment model.",
    "Very few examples per class; minority-class estimates are highly unstable.",
    "Cross-validation measures agreement with provisional text annotations, not independently verified sentiment.",
    "Vocabulary is fit inside each fold; test comments never contribute to training features.",
    "No synthetic rows, oversampling, or test-set tuning.",
    "Names, review dates, and ratings are not inference features.",
    "Clause extraction and vocabulary-based category matching require separate human evaluation.",
    "Posterior scores are uncalibrated; unknown vocabulary can fall back to class priors."
  ]
}
